~ start
match CutsceneController.object_id
	when "One"
		NPC One: Hello {{Player.player_name}}! This is test room 1!
		=> END
	when "Two"
		NPC Two: I'm NPC two!
		=> END
	when "Three"
		NPC Three: Remember to report bugs, {{Player.player_name}}!
		NPC Three: ...Are snails bugs? Should you report us too?
		NPC Three: Or are bugs strictly insects...
		NPC Three: This may just be the greatest question of our time...
		=> END
	when "Four"
		NPC Four: Watch {{Player.player_name}}! I'm going to jump off of this wall!
		do CutsceneController.set_actor("Four")
		do CutsceneController.perform_action("jump", true)
		NPC Four: I'm on the ground now!
	when "Five"
		placeholder